1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,562
Now a beautiful one.

2
00:00:01,562 --> 00:00:05,481
Benzene diazonium chloride is a weak electrophile.

3
00:00:05,481 --> 00:00:13,906
It can only attack a strongly activated ring, like the phenoxide ion in cold alkali, at zero to five degrees.

4
00:00:13,906 --> 00:00:16,093
It attacks the para position.

